OL,3,AEx-Poundland owner says he'd invest in
OL,4,Afirm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former owner of Poundland has said
OL,7,Fhe would invest in the firm as a
OL,8,Fgovernment minister said she would meet
OL,9,Fthe firm's board.
OL,11,FSteve Smith, who left the business in
OL,12,F2006, said he had attempted to contact
OL,13,Fowners Gordon Brothers having been
OL,14,F"really surprised" to learn about them
OL,15,Ffiling for administration when sales
OL,16,Fwere up 11% on last year.
OL,18,FThe BBC understands that Business
OL,19,FMinister Kate Dearden will meet with
OL,20,Fsenior Poundland executives later this
OL,21,Fweek to discuss the company's
OL,22,Fthreatened insolvency.
